{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Kollectomaniac is a game about running a shop in the woods on a log. You work for a man named Dlarlnod, your landlord.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;Work at my shop for free, all you have to do is pay me rent every four days.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>-Dlarlnod</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You buy items from weird people called Walkers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are nine walkers, each with distinct and slightly random personalities.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">These personalities change how skittish they are, affect item prices, and give each walker a distinct feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491740/extras/Meet_the_Walkers.png?t=1743286725\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491740/extras/Walker_Run_Up.gif?t=1743286725\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each playthrough starts the same: You purchase your first items, and spend any leftover money on the &quot;Display Stand&quot;, which lets you sell those items back to the walkers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><br>By saving up money and learning the average price of items, you can spend any spare cents at the shop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491740/extras/Improve_your_store.png?t=1743286725\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491740/extras/Buy_Hat.gif?t=1743286725\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The worm sells various items including hats, mechanical &quot;statistic trackers&quot; and items you can use during the buying and selling phase of the game.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What's the Goal? Survive.<br>Every five days is <strong><i>Collection Day.</i></strong>\u00a0If you can't make Collection Day:\u00a0You must surrender...</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Tarreah","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3491740/ee365fce368e07416522a441ffe9b13ee4cd388f.jpg"},{"name":"Errah","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3491740/48848ac4d5e4736eecff4b011f2586c26e361e19.jpg"},{"name":"Click Click Click","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3491740/f7e18538726cc43aa7c42f86a215a3cec9802958.jpg"},{"name":"Hmmm Her hear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3491740/c5c566beb865d7ce3b1e12574a94cf33a7fe5300.jpg"},{"name":"Teylah","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3491740/2c22156f4c460ac810d9989e8427cb3f16766924.jpg"},{"name":"Heuhhhh","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3491740/96f0b1839936c572cf3e24b830e94a4d32e7c562.jpg"},{"name":"He-hello...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3491740/aeeb6ce52f3bfffd6d9baa536bbf63bf116b485e.jpg"},{"name":"Reahruh!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3491740/292e386c8ab98f683ee5874ad388bf0dba4d9dd0.jpg"},{"name":"Hurhmmmurhhhhh","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3491740/fa101af2f7e50181231fc3d8289048b2fbb020ba.jpg"},{"name":"Total Discount","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3491740/478a5de3f0ec6ffad5d58989a51bc0a2a33212cf.jpg"}],"total":30},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3491740?t=1743286725","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3491740?t=1743286725","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor